This product is a C# / .NET reimplementation of Obscura
(https://github.com/h4ckf0r0day/obscura), a headless browser engine written in
Rust. Obscura is Copyright the Obscura authors and contributors, and is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its license is kept, unmodified, at
.reference/obscura/LICENSE, alongside the source tree this port was derived from.

The layout engine is a port of Taffy (https://github.com/DioxusLabs/taffy),
Copyright (c) 2018 Visly Inc. and Copyright (c) 2026 Taffy Authors, licensed
under the MIT License (.reference/obscura/vendor/taffy/LICENSE).

The text layout layer follows cosmic-text (https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-text),
Copyright (c) 2022 System76, licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (.reference/obscura/vendor/cosmic-text/LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE).

The fonts embedded in dotnet/src/Obscura.Render/Assets/ are byte-identical
copies of the ones Obscura bundles, and keep their own licenses: Liberation
(SIL Open Font License 1.1), DejaVu (Bitstream Vera / DejaVu license), and Noto
Color Emoji (SIL Open Font License 1.1, see LICENSE-NOTO-COLOR-EMOJI.txt and
FONT-PROVENANCE.md in that folder).
